# Action to search for a specific visual tag within a given radius.
#
# This action defines a goal to search for a visual tag, provides feedback on
# current position during search, and returns success status with found location.

# Goal: Search parameters.
# proposed_point: Central point of the search area.
# search_radius: Radius in meters around proposed_point to search within.
# tag_name: Identifier of the tag to be found.
geometry_msgs/PointStamped proposed_point
float64 search_radius
string tag_name

---

# Result: Outcome of the search operation.
# success: true if the search was successful, false otherwise.
# found_point: Coordinates where tag was located (only valid if success is true).
# message: Human-readable information (e.g., error message).
bool success
geometry_msgs/PointStamped found_point
string message

---

# Feedback: Progress updates during search.
# current_position: Current position of the searching agent (e.g., UAV).
geometry_msgs/PointStamped current_position
